			<div id="contenttext">
				<p class="body_text" align="justify"> <a name="interest"></a><strong>My current research interests</strong> span distributed machine learning systems and algorithms, and intelligent elderly/child care technologies. My research features both performance modeling/algorithm design and design/implementation of various (networked) systems based on optimization theory and machine learning methods. 
					<br />
                <hr />
				
				<!--
                <p class="title_panel3" align="justify"> | <a href="#current">Current Research Projects</a> | <a href="#past">Past Research Projects</a> | </p>
				
                <hr />	
					-->
				<p class="title_panel3" align="justify"> <a name="current">Research Projects</a></p>
                       		<p class="title_blue" align="justify"> <img alt="Project-icon" src="images/work-group-icon.png" width="30" height="30" align="left"/>Distributed Machine Learning Algorithms</p>
                        	<p class="body_text" align="left">
							&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; We work on deep understanding and efficient algorithm design for distributed machine learning.	<br />
