                            <p class="title_blue" align="justify"> <img alt="Project-icon" src="images/work-group-icon.png" width="30" height="30" align="left"/>Resource Scheduling, Scaling, Pricing, and Data Migration in Cloud Data Centers or Geo-distributed Clouds</a></p>
