                             <p class="title_blue" align="justify"> <img alt="Project-icon" src="images/work-group-icon.png" width="30" height="30" align="left"/>Data Center Demand Response</a></p>
                             <p class="body_text" align="left">
                             &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; We have studied efficient incentive mechanisms and resource schedulers for data center demand resource.	<br />
